.Dd July 11, 2026
.Dt GEMSTASH-CTL 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm gemstash-ctl
.Nd manage the gemstash RubyGems caching proxy and private gem host
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Fl -json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
controls gemstash, a pull-through cache for rubygems.org and a private gem
server, run as a persistent launchd service on 127.0.0.1:9292. Metadata lives in
a dedicated
.Sy gemstash
Postgres database on the zdots postgres@18 server (peer/trust as the OS user \(em
no password, no secret in the plist); the
.Sy my
Knowledge Layer database is untouched, and gemstash self-migrates its own schema.
Cached .gem files live on disk under ~/.gemstash. Manage it via
.Ic zsvc Ar verb Cm gemstash ;
this script is the authoritative ctl backing that.
.Pp
The service binds loopback only; nginx terminates TLS for
.Sy https://gemstash.localhost
(Z-205 cutover). Bundler's mirror deliberately stays on the raw
http://127.0.0.1:9292 endpoint \(em Ruby's OpenSSL does not read the macOS
keychain, so the mkcert CA is invisible to it, and a loopback mirror gains
nothing from TLS. The gem CLI routes through the same endpoint via ~/.gemrc
:sources (gemstash first, rubygems.org second so a stopped gemstash degrades
to a warning instead of breaking installs); both ~/.gemrc and ~/.default-gems
are adots-tracked.
.Pp
The launchd agent is installed with RunAtLoad and KeepAlive, so it restarts on
crash and returns after a reboot once you log in (user LaunchAgents load at
login, not headless boot). To confirm after a reboot, run
.Ic zsvc status gemstash :
it should report running with no manual start.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width restart
.It Cm init
Generate ~/.gemstash/config.yml (Postgres backend, loopback bind).
.It Cm install
Register the macOS launchd service (KeepAlive, RunAtLoad); runs
.Cm init
first when no config exists.
.It Cm start
Load and start the service.
.It Cm stop
Unload and stop the service.
.It Cm restart
Stop then start.
.It Cm status Op Fl -json
Show service state and process info.
.It Cm health Op Fl -json
Exit 0 if the service answers on 127.0.0.1:9292, 1 otherwise.
.It Cm logs
Tail the service log.
.It Cm run
launchd entry point: set up env, exec gemstash in the foreground. Internal; not
for interactive use.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTDIR
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
zdots root; sourced for the service-lifecycle helpers.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.gemstash.plist"
.It Pa ~/.gemstash/config.yml
gemstash configuration (generated by
.Cm init Ns ).
.It Pa ~/.gemstash/gem_cache
Cached .gem files and per-gem properties.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.zdots.gemstash.plist
launchd agent definition (generated by
.Cm install Ns ).
.It Pa $XDG_STATE_HOME/zsh/gemstash.log
Service log.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr gemstash-metadata 1 ,
.Xr zsvc 8 ,
.Xr zdots-ctl 8
